[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 6901.189, "timestamp": "01:55:01", "text": "或是想吸引法國觀眾之類的，"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 6903.403, "timestamp": "01:55:03", "author": "@nuclearmaidch", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/MS3mIduhKynDUQHTdAP09smm9-S_B6gqCjrteh5PLq8oahJNV_6F7Nz1MLSlqRPjz4ot-KSp-8Y=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "ooooh got it"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6906.47, "timestamp": "01:55:06", "text": "你可以做法語直播之類的，對吧？法語內容之類的東西，對吧？西班牙語內容，諸如此類，對吧？就像管樂起源於日本一樣，所有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6917.43, "timestamp": "01:55:17", "text": "文化都等同於日本的偶像文化，對吧？所以，這"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6924.55, "timestamp": "01:55:24", "text": "不是你喜歡學習日文的必要"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 6930.042, "timestamp": "01:55:30", "author": "@nuclearmaidch", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/MS3mIduhKynDUQHTdAP09smm9-S_B6gqCjrteh5PLq8oahJNV_6F7Nz1MLSlqRPjz4ot-KSp-8Y=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "focus on myself, building a viewer base and content first then explore new stuff"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6933.589, "timestamp": "01:55:33", "text": "條件。有些 YouTuber 甚至不懂日語，對吧？  所以，如果你熱愛日本，熱愛日本文化，熱愛日本的一切，也喜歡日本語本身，如果你想學習日本語，願意投入時間和精力去學習，學習一門語言真的很有趣，對吧？無論是日語還是其他任何語言，學習都很"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 6935.751, "timestamp": "01:55:35", "author": "@nuclearmaidch", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/MS3mIduhKynDUQHTdAP09smm9-S_B6gqCjrteh5PLq8oahJNV_6F7Nz1MLSlqRPjz4ot-KSp-8Y=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "UCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/m8MfY4jbFsWJhL0PyouA2Ak"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6937.43, "timestamp": "01:55:37", "text": "有趣，但你必須投入大量時間，對吧？是的，很好。學習語言總是有益的。現在還有什麼比這更好的外出方式呢？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6959.83, "timestamp": "01:55:59", "text": "你可以用這種方式和人們交談。  是的，這是另一個很有用的技能。  是的，正確。"}]